SUMMARY:Veterans Day fee-free entrance at Gulf Islands National Seashore
LOCATION:Gulf Islands National Seashore\, 1801 Gulf Breeze Parkway\, Gulf B
 reeze\, FL 32563
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday 11/11 · All day\n\nThe National Park Service waives 
 the entrance fee on Veterans Day at every site that charges one. At Gulf I
 slands National Seashore that covers the Fort Pickens\, Opal Beach and Joh
 nson Beach areas in Florida. Ferry rides and other fees still apply\, and 
 the park does not take cash.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleve
 ntures.com/events/ev-gulf-islands-fee-free-veterans-day-1111.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-gulf-islands-fee-free-veterans-d
 ay-1111.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
