DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/14 to Sunday 11/15 · 9:00 AM to 4:30 PM\n\nGulfari
 um Marine Adventure Park lets kids ages 12 and under in free on November 1
 4 and 15 with a paying adult. Each paying adult can bring up to two free k
 ids. The park is the home of the dolphin and sea lion shows on Okaloosa Is
 land. The adult ticket price is not printed on the event page\, so check i
 t before you drive.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coast
 aleventures.com/events/ev-gulfarium-kids-free-weekend-1114.html
