SUMMARY:Junior Rangers: Shark Scientist at Gulf State Park
LOCATION:Gulf State Park Saltwater Pier\, 20800 East Beach Boulevard\, Gulf
  Shores\, AL 36542
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/14 · 10:00 AM\n\nChildren ages 6 to 12 spend a mor
 ning as shark scientists with a Gulf State Park naturalist. They look at p
 reserved specimens and real shark teeth\, learn which sharks live around t
 he park\, and then walk out on the pier to watch for a shark in the water 
 below. The program costs $5 per child\, and a parent must stay but does no
 t register.\n\nPrice: from $5\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/eve
 nts/ev-gsp-junior-rangers-shark-scientist-1114.html
