 Esther Library\, looking for foxes\, owls\, flying squirrels and bats. Thi
 s walk is the library's tween\, teen and adult session\, open to ages 12 a
 nd up. The group starts at the library at 4:30 PM and crosses the street t
 o the park at the crosswalk\, and the walk lasts about an hour and a half.
