DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/21 · 3:00 PM to 9:00 PM\n\nEmerald Coast Food Resc
 ue gathers regional food producers at T's Farm in Baker for a free outdoor
  community meal and a fishing tournament for kids. The evening ends with a
  campfire session by local songwriters. Guests can stay the night with a p
 aid camping package that includes coffee and breakfast the next morning.\n
 \nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-farm-to-f
 lame-ts-farm-1121.html
