SUMMARY:Mifflin Lake Cruise at Historic Blakeley
LOCATION:Historic Blakeley State Park\, 34745 State Hwy 225\, Spanish Fort\
 , AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 12/5 · 1:00 PM to 3:00 PM\n\nHistoric Blakeley State 
 Park runs a cruise into the upper reaches of the Mobile-Tensaw Delta that 
 explores the Tensaw River and Mifflin Lake. The winding waterway sits betw
 een the Tensaw and Middle rivers and is home to a lot of wildlife. It is a
  short distance from what was once an international boundary between the U
 nited States and a Spanish colony.\n\nPrice: from $19\n\nDetails: https://
 coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-mifflin-lake-cruise-1205.html
